-- Lab 6 - NRQL Predictions (predictive AI). Paste ONE query at a time into Query your data and Run.
-- PREDICT extends the chart with a forecast (dashed) and a confidence band (Holt-Winters). It needs history:
-- a few hours of loadgen traffic (3-4 h is enough for 5-minute buckets). A fresh account has nothing to predict.
-- Clause order is PREDICT [holtwinters(...)] [BY <span>] [USING <span>]; USING before BY is a syntax error.
-- History buckets + forecast buckets must stay under 366 (NRDB limit): widen the bucket when you look further out.
-- Billing: PREDICT queries consume Core CCUs (not Advanced Compute). Verified on 2026-11-07.

-- ========== A. Live window (cluster has been running for the last hours) ==========

-- A1. Request count per 5 minutes, last 6 hours, default forecast (about 1/5 of the window ahead).
SELECT count(*) FROM Transaction WHERE appName = 'SimplCommerce'
TIMESERIES 5 minutes SINCE 6 hours ago
PREDICT

-- A2. Look further, train longer: 2 hours ahead using 12 hours of history.
SELECT count(*) FROM Transaction WHERE appName = 'SimplCommerce'
TIMESERIES 5 minutes SINCE 12 hours ago
PREDICT BY 2 hours USING 12 hours

-- A3. Capacity trend ("memory full in N days"): SQL Server working set on the kind node, 2 days ahead.
-- (K8sVolumeSample on kind carries no pvcName for mssql-data, so a PVC forecast is empty here.)
SELECT average(memoryWorkingSetBytes)/1e6 FROM K8sContainerSample WHERE containerName = 'mssql'
TIMESERIES 1 hour SINCE 3 days ago
PREDICT BY 2 days

-- ========== B. Past window (the cluster was stopped overnight and the last hours are empty) ==========
-- WSL2 stops the VM when the last shell closes, and a stopped cluster has no recent traffic. PREDICT also works on an
-- absolute window: the forecast starts at the UNTIL mark. Find your last continuous block of traffic first:
--   SELECT count(*) FROM Transaction WHERE appName = 'SimplCommerce' SINCE 3 days ago TIMESERIES 2 hours
-- then replace the two timestamps below (keep the UTC offset). Verified 2026-11-17 on the 15/11 21:00 - 16/11 07:00 block.

-- B1. Same as A1 on the past block.
SELECT count(*) FROM Transaction WHERE appName = 'SimplCommerce'
SINCE '2026-11-15 21:00:00 +07:00' UNTIL '2026-11-16 07:00:00 +07:00'
TIMESERIES 5 minutes PREDICT

-- B2. Same as A2 on the past block (8 hours of training inside a 10-hour window).
SELECT count(*) FROM Transaction WHERE appName = 'SimplCommerce'
SINCE '2026-11-15 21:00:00 +07:00' UNTIL '2026-11-16 07:00:00 +07:00'
TIMESERIES 10 minutes PREDICT BY 2 hours USING 8 hours

-- B3. Same as A3 on the past block. With no upward trend in the history the forecast is flat: PREDICT needs a trend.
SELECT average(memoryWorkingSetBytes)/1e6 FROM K8sContainerSample WHERE containerName = 'mssql'
SINCE '2026-11-15 19:00:00 +07:00' UNTIL '2026-11-16 07:00:00 +07:00'
TIMESERIES 1 hour PREDICT BY 2 days
